\@writefile{lot}{\contentsline {table}{\numberline {1}{\ignorespaces  Warsaw-basis dimension-six operators contributing to neutral-current Drell-Yan production $pp \to \mu ^+\mu ^-$ at tree level, organised by the leading power counting of their interference with, or square against, the Standard Model amplitude. Here $v$ is the electroweak scale and $\hat  {s}$ the partonic centre-of-mass energy. The grouping follows~\cite  {DasBakshi:2025reusable} and the calculation of~\cite  {Greljo:2017vvb}. The four operators marked $\star $ span the directions used in the closed-loop demonstration of Section~\ref {sec:loop} and the empirical comparison of Section~\ref {sec:empirical}.}}{5}{table.caption.2}\protected@file@percent }
