\newlabel{tab:bimodal}{{2}{14}{Final-state root-mean-square error on the bimodal target band $\bm {c}_\star = (-0.5, 0, 0.8, 0)$, averaged over five random seeds of the closed-loop run. ``After-loop'' is the RMSE on the $50$-point target band after the $500$-oracle-call budget is exhausted, evaluated outside the trace. Numbers from \texttt {experiments/full-chain-run/output\_bimodal\_parallel/aggregate.json}}{table.caption.11}{}}
