\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {8}{\ignorespaces  Ridge-weight latent geometry of the closed-form head over the SMEFT prior. Centre: the first two principal components of the implicit ridge weight $\bm  {w}_\theta $ across $240$ Wilson configurations. Circles are scenarios drawn from the training box $|c_i| \leq 0.7$; triangles are scenarios from the extrapolation annulus $0.7 < \max _i |c_i| \leq 1.0$. Colour encodes the leading Fisher-eigenbasis direction $\tilde  c_1 \approx +0.64\,c_{\ell q}^{(3)} - 0.77\,c_{\ell q}^{(1)}$ from Section~\ref {sec:disclosure}. Corners: four representative configurations, ringed in the scatter and linked by a thin grey connector to a thumbnail of the underlying spectrum. Each thumbnail plots $\mu (m_{\ell \ell }) = \sigma (\bm  {c}, m_{\ell \ell })/\sigma _{\rm  SM}(m_{\ell \ell })$ on a logarithmic vertical axis over $m_{\ell \ell }\in [0.3, 2.3]$~TeV, with the SM at $\mu = 1$ (dashed) and the two leading Wilson coefficients labelled in the upper-left corner.}}{19}{figure.caption.19}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:key}{{8}{19}{Ridge-weight latent geometry of the closed-form head over the SMEFT prior. Centre: the first two principal components of the implicit ridge weight $\bm {w}_\theta $ across $240$ Wilson configurations. Circles are scenarios drawn from the training box $|c_i| \leq 0.7$; triangles are scenarios from the extrapolation annulus $0.7 < \max _i |c_i| \leq 1.0$. Colour encodes the leading Fisher-eigenbasis direction $\tilde c_1 \approx +0.64\,c_{\ell q}^{(3)} - 0.77\,c_{\ell q}^{(1)}$ from Section~\ref {sec:disclosure}. Corners: four representative configurations, ringed in the scatter and linked by a thin grey connector to a thumbnail of the underlying spectrum. Each thumbnail plots $\mu (\mll ) = \sigma (\bm {c}, \mll )/\sigsm (\mll )$ on a logarithmic vertical axis over $\mll \in [0.3, 2.3]$~TeV, with the SM at $\mu = 1$ (dashed) and the two leading Wilson coefficients labelled in the upper-left corner}{figure.caption.19}{}}
